OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start with early mist
OL,6,Fand fog patches soon clearing.
OL,7,FOtherwise, it will be mostly dry and
OL,8,Ffine, with sunny spells and only a
OL,9,Fslight chance of a shower in the
OL,10,Fnorth. Temperatures near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining dry and fine
OL,13,Fovernight with lengthy clear skies. A
OL,14,Ffew mist and fog patches forming under
OL,15,Fthe clear skies, with temperatures
OL,16,Ffalling into single figures in rural
OL,17,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
