OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAnother dry and fine day with
OL,6,Fa mix of cloud and sunny spells.
OL,7,FFeeling a little warmer, especially in
OL,8,Fthe sunshine.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,11,FStaying mostly dry on Tuesday, before
OL,12,Frain bands and showers move in
OL,13,Fmidweek. Some heavy, thundery rain is
OL,14,Fpossible, with warmer, more humid
OL,15,Fconditions for a time.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
